title Copal, surface p49 rostered
prompt Run the copal inner prompt's fruit: claim one unrostered chapter witness under tools/gen/chapter/, roster it, and prove it from both sides.
think The unrostered list by comm against the roster's guard paths named four: instrument_suite, remember_pin_history_tidy, surface_season_p49, and surface_season_p54. I took surface_season_p49 because its counsel anchor and metal symbols are present on this clone.
think The claim went first. fleet_claim.sh --open named copal-roster-surface-p49 over the witness and the roster file, and the card's Git nib was carried in the same stage. The first two commit attempts were refused by the commit-msg hook for mechanism words; the third carried enough, and the push was rejected non-fast-forward, so a pull --rebase ran before the push landed.
think On its face the p49 witness skipped GREEN, because brushstroke/bin/brushstroke-wayland-seed is not built here, and its metal scan ran after that skip. A skip on this clone therefore read nothing about the source.
think I moved the feed-symbol metal scan above the built-binary skip, the same ordering p57 took under REDS %646. The skip logic and every later claim stayed as they were.
think Both sides were proven in a throwaway pen. On the real tree the witness exits GREEN through the honest skip. In the pen, a seed with fn lines_from_brush_src renamed to fn lines_renamed_away refused at surface-p49: feed symbols scan failed with exit 1. A first mutation that only appended a suffix passed, since grep -q matches a prefix; that was my mutation's fault, not the witness's, and the replant showed the refusal.
think The roster block was appended to construction/standing-equipment.kyri on the cadence tier. The scoped runner by name answered guards_run=1 guards_red=0 run_verdict=ok. The roster witness answered GREEN with control_failures=0.
obs The skip path still means the live brushtest leg did not run here; the live legs need the built seed and Wayland dev libraries, which this clone lacks.
obs I did not run the full cold endurance run before the work nor the hot run after staging. The scoped roster run covers one guard, and the full choir remains for a launch that owns a stillness window.
obs The index shelf for 20261010 already carries two rows above its delimiter. I inserted this lap's row under the delimiter and left the two rows for their own repair.
rota lap 9506, row 1 -- air feels; the boundary under the hand is the witness's own skip-or-refuse edge, read in the file before the roster row was written.
